---
---

<section class="section-pad bg-stone-950 text-white relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[url('https://www.transparenttextures.com/patterns/stardust.png')] opacity-20 pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute -top-40 -right-40 w-96 h-96 bg-primary-900 rounded-full blur-[120px] opacity-50"></div>
  <div class="absolute -bottom-40 -left-40 w-96 h-96 bg-coral-900 rounded-full blur-[120px] opacity-30"></div>

  <div class="page-shell relative z-10">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center mb-16">
      <div class="reveal-on-scroll chip mb-6 !border-white/10 !bg-slate-800/50 !text-slate-300">
        <span class="mini-label !text-slate-400">Beyond Chatbots</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="reveal-on-scroll section-title text-white">
        Not another chatbot.<br/>
        <span class="text-slate-400">Your AI Operations Manager.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="reveal-on-scroll mt-6 section-copy text-slate-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Most chatbots just sit and wait for a message. VoluChat acts like a proactive ops team—monitoring your live Shopify data, recovering carts, and executing follow-up campaigns automatically, all while you stay in control.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <!-- Old Way -->
      <div class="reveal-on-scroll reveal-delay-100 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/50 p-8 backdrop-blur-sm">
        <div class="mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-slate-800 text-slate-400 font-bold">
            X
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-300">Traditional Chatbots</h3>
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-slate-400">
            <svg class="mt-1 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-slate-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12" />
            </svg>
            <span>Wait for the customer to start a conversation.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-slate-400">
            <svg class="mt-1 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-slate-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12" />
            </svg>
            <span>Only understand basic keyword matching.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-slate-400">
            <svg class="mt-1 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-slate-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12" />
            </svg>
            <span>Require manual setup of endless flowcharts.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-slate-400">
            <svg class="mt-1 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-slate-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12" />
            </svg>
            <span>Disconnect entirely from your Shopify inventory and cart data.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- New Way -->
      <div class="reveal-on-scroll reveal-delay-200 rounded-2xl border border-primary-500/30 bg-primary-950/40 p-8 backdrop-blur-sm relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-primary-500/10 blur-[50px] rounded-full"></div>
        <div class="mb-6 flex items-center gap-3 relative z-10">
          <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary-500 text-white font-bold">
            <svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
              <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">VoluChat AI Operations</h3>
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-4 relative z-10">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-primary-100">
            <svg class="mt-1 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-primary-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
            <span>Watches commerce events (abandoned carts, slow stock).</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-primary-100">
            <svg class="mt-1 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-primary-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
            <span>Proactively recommends actions to recover revenue.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-primary-100">
            <svg class="mt-1 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-primary-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
            <span>Asks for human approval before executing sensitive campaigns.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-primary-100">
            <svg class="mt-1 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-primary-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
            <span>Attributes outcomes automatically (e.g. +$108 recovered).</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
